From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] opengl32: wow64 pointer getters, glGetUniformOffsetEXT, wglAllocateMemoryNV, unthunkable extensions withheld (3635)

opengl32: wow64 pointer getters, glGetUniformOffsetEXT, wglAllocateMemoryNV, unthunkable extensions withheld

unix_thunks.c is regenerated with make_opengl (scratch copy, cache in work/oglgen; wgl_driver.h untouched). Gate fastb-gapogl (64- and 32-bit probe, DSA getters exercised on llvmpipe). Mutants: SG_MUTANT_WOW64_EXT (filter) and two thunk edits (glGetPointerv write, glGetPointerIndexedvEXT write) shown caught. opengl32 conformance 64/32: 0 failures as stock. Unverified on hardware: glGetTexParameterPointervAPPLE, glGetVariantPointervEXT, glGetVertexAttribPointervNV, glGetUniformOffsetEXT, wglAllocateMemoryNV (extensions not exposed by llvmpipe). CORE review: glGetPointerv fix. 
